(7502377, 1195799, 186753, '<td valign="top">REally Really love this shot. The one thing that keeps me from scoring it higher is minimilism says to me minimal color, minimal subject matter, mostly negative space and this image is so rich in color. Love this image all around.</td>', 'REally Really love this shot. The one thing that keeps me from scoring it higher is minimilism says to me minimal color, minimal subject matter, mostly negative space and this image is so rich in color. Love this image all around.', '2017-02-26 18:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502477, 1195860, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is simply brilliant</td>', 'This is simply brilliant', '2017-02-27 10:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502478, 1195876, 114225, '<td valign="top">Some real power to this photo.</td>', 'Some real power to this photo.', '2017-02-27 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502479, 1195609, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, good. I am wondering what it would look like composed with less sky and more hill.</td>', 'Overall, good. I am wondering what it would look like composed with less sky and more hill.', '2017-02-27 10:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502481, 1195777, 114225, '<td valign="top">Do you have some of those cheapo ND filters that give the purple cast too?<br/> <br/>I wish the shadow areas weren''t quite so dark.</td>', 'Do you have some of those cheapo ND filters that give the purple cast too? I wish the shadow areas weren''t quite so dark.', '2017-02-27 10:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502482, 1195518, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Maybe a little more brightness would help liven everything up.</td>', 'Nicely done. Maybe a little more brightness would help liven everything up.', '2017-02-27 10:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502483, 1195908, 114225, '<td valign="top">This would likely look a little better if it were cropped tighter on the left (that lamp post doesn''t add any value).</td>', 'This would likely look a little better if it were cropped tighter on the left (that lamp post doesn''t add any value).', '2017-02-27 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502484, 1195799, 114225, '<td valign="top">That is sublime. Great colors and combination of smooth/sharp.</td>', 'That is sublime. Great colors and combination of smooth/sharp.', '2017-02-27 10:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502486, 1195793, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, good black and white conversion.<br/> <br/>If I hold my hand up to crop the left tighter (don''t need those two little rocks), the photo seems to have more balance.</td>', 'Lovely photo, good black and white conversion. If I hold my hand up to crop the left tighter (don''t need those two little rocks), the photo seems to have more balance.', '2017-02-27 10:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502487, 1195848, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, really great scene.<br/> <br/>But I''m wondering why the sky is so dark in some places. Did you use a polarizer on a wide angle lens?</td>', 'Wow, really great scene. But I''m wondering why the sky is so dark in some places. Did you use a polarizer on a wide angle lens?', '2017-02-27 10:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502497, 1195848, 56502, '<td valign="top">For my eyes a bit over the top on the saturation.</td>', 'For my eyes a bit over the top on the saturation.', '2017-02-27 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502498, 1195776, 114225, '<td valign="top">One thing to watch out for with wide angle lenses is distortion at the edges. IF you fixed the distortion of this in post processing, I bet it would look cleaner and nicer.</td>', 'One thing to watch out for with wide angle lenses is distortion at the edges. IF you fixed the distortion of this in post processing, I bet it would look cleaner and nicer.', '2017-02-27 11:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502499, 1195241, 114225, '<td valign="top">Kind of a lot going on with this photo. Trees, a curved patch, lots of long shadows.<br/>It''s a nice photo, but it''s not very minimal.</td>', 'Kind of a lot going on with this photo. Trees, a curved patch, lots of long shadows.It''s a nice photo, but it''s not very minimal.', '2017-02-27 11:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502500, 1195817, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. Kind of a stretch to call this minimalism. There is a lot going on here.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. Kind of a stretch to call this minimalism. There is a lot going on here.', '2017-02-27 11:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502501, 1195454, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think you cranked the sharpening slider high, giving this an strange feel. Take a look at the halo it created around the person.</td>', 'I think you cranked the sharpening slider high, giving this an strange feel. Take a look at the halo it created around the person.', '2017-02-27 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502502, 1195608, 114225, '<td valign="top">I adore this photo.<br/> <br/>It''s teetering on the edge of minimalism. The B&amp;W helps, but with all of the rocky and tree details, hard to say how people will react to finding it "minimal".</td>', 'I adore this photo. It''s teetering on the edge of minimalism. The B&W helps, but with all of the rocky and tree details, hard to say how people will react to finding it "minimal".', '2017-02-27 11:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502503, 1195670, 114225, '<td valign="top">Sure is hard to make the brown dead field look good, isn''t it? Maybe try adding a bit of green in processing to see if that helps.</td>', 'Sure is hard to make the brown dead field look good, isn''t it? Maybe try adding a bit of green in processing to see if that helps.', '2017-02-27 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502504, 1195857, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of natural framing here.<br/> <br/>But what I don''t like is the overdone sky. Those clouds are miles away from you. Further away than the horizon. So they shouldn''t look sharper than the horizon does, that is not natural.<br/> <br/>Try re-editing this, but keep the Clarity adjustment far away from the sky. I'', curious how that turns out.</td>', 'Nice use of natural framing here. But what I don''t like is the overdone sky. Those clouds are miles away from you. Further away than the horizon. So they shouldn''t look sharper than the horizon does, that is not natural. Try re-editing this, but keep the Clarity adjustment far away from the sky. I'', curious how that turns out.', '2017-02-27 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502690, 1195788, 114285, '<td valign="top">Stunning PP and minimalism! My pick for the red.</td>', 'Stunning PP and minimalism! My pick for the red.', '2017-02-27 23:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502699, 1195128, 114285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mood, and it meets the challenge well. My top pick.</td>', 'Beautiful mood, and it meets the challenge well. My top pick.', '2017-02-28 01:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503067, 1195241, 150202, '<td valign="top">The landscape here doesn''t look minimalist nor does it draw me in. I like the shadows the trees are making on the snow in the foreground.</td>', 'The landscape here doesn''t look minimalist nor does it draw me in. I like the shadows the trees are making on the snow in the foreground.', '2017-03-02 07:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503070, 1195909, 150202, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem to be a landscape and the lack of colors or identifiable objects doesn''t do it for me. It looks like something under the water on the right, I would have loved to see more of whatever that is in this shot!</td>', 'This doesn''t seem to be a landscape and the lack of colors or identifiable objects doesn''t do it for me. It looks like something under the water on the right, I would have loved to see more of whatever that is in this shot!', '2017-03-02 07:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503072, 1195752, 150202, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to fit as a minimalist landscape, especially with the buildings and there''s not much to draw me in. I like the greens of the trees.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to fit as a minimalist landscape, especially with the buildings and there''s not much to draw me in. I like the greens of the trees.', '2017-03-02 07:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503074, 1195910, 150202, '<td valign="top">I don''t see minimalist landscape, perhaps a different title would have helped. Interesting abstract though.</td>', 'I don''t see minimalist landscape, perhaps a different title would have helped. Interesting abstract though.', '2017-03-02 07:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503076, 1195799, 150202, '<td valign="top">Perfect! Beautiful sky, serene landscape. There is so little in this photo which keeps it minimalist, but what is there has impact. A 10 from me.</td>', 'Perfect! Beautiful sky, serene landscape. There is so little in this photo which keeps it minimalist, but what is there has impact. A 10 from me.', '2017-03-02 07:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
