(7503538, 1195648, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dennisheckman:</b></div><hr/><i> Are you liking your new home Paul? I love images of grass! Congrats on HM with this stunning image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I really like it - great scenery, lovely people and currently it takes me 4 minutes to get to work, while being 4 minutes from the beach (this one) - the sea is just over the dunes.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dennisheckman: Are you liking your new home Paul? I love images of grass! Congrats on HM with this stunning image.   I really like it - great scenery, lovely people and currently it takes me 4 minutes to get to work, while being 4 minutes from the beach (this one) - the sea is just over the dunes.', '2017-03-03 15:43:13.000000', NULL, 0);
