(7503591, 1195271, 175381, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for your very nice comments and for the votes you gave me that have a special feeling for me. Let me explain. First, the picture was taken by going to visit my mother-in-law at the hospital. A week after taking this picture she died. So, I would like to dedicate this picture to this extraordinary person whom I loved with tenderness and respect. In second, it is my first ribbon, a blue ribbon in addition using my new Sony camera which was recommended by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bear_Music</a>. Third, the opportunity to enjoy my passion by your gratitude. I am a happy guy thanks to you. Once again a thank you from the bottom of my heart.<br/> <br/>Best Regards</td>', 'Thank you very much for your very nice comments and for the votes you gave me that have a special feeling for me. Let me explain. First, the picture was taken by going to visit my mother-in-law at the hospital. A week after taking this picture she died. So, I would like to dedicate this picture to this extraordinary person whom I loved with tenderness and respect. In second, it is my first ribbon, a blue ribbon in addition using my new Sony camera which was recommended by  bear_Music. Third, the opportunity to enjoy my passion by your gratitude. I am a happy guy thanks to you. Once again a thank you from the bottom of my heart. Best Regards', '2017-03-03 20:48:45.000000', NULL, 0),
